{"id":"wd-01","ask":"what is a dog a kind of","query":{"type":"k.words.sense","where":{"word":"dog","pos":"noun","n":1},"seek":"is_a"},"expect":{"status":"supported","values":["canine","\"domestic animal\""]}}
{"id":"wd-02","ask":"what does tree mean","query":{"type":"k.words.sense","where":{"word":"tree","pos":"noun","n":1},"seek":"gloss"},"expect":{"status":"supported","value":"\"a tall perennial woody plant having a main trunk and branches forming a distinct elevated crown; includes both gymnosperms and angiosperms\""}}
{"id":"wd-03","ask":"what is a wheel a part of","query":{"type":"k.words.sense","where":{"word":"wheel","pos":"noun","n":1},"seek":"part_of"},"expect":{"status":"supported","value":"\"wheeled vehicle\""}}
{"id":"wd-04","ask":"what is another word for car","query":{"type":"k.words.sense","where":{"word":"car","pos":"noun","n":1},"seek":"synonym"},"expect":{"status":"supported","values":["auto","automobile","machine","motorcar"]}}
